+          "text": "# 10. Dependency Overview\n\n```text\n\n                                         Document Identity\n                                                 │\n            ┌──────────────────┬─────────────────┼──────────────────┬────────────────────┐\n            │                  │                 │                  │                    │\n            ▼                  ▼                 ▼                  ▼                    ▼\n\n        Metadata        Classification        Registry        Relationships       Knowledge Graph\n\n            │\n            ▼\n\n       Governance\n            │\n            ▼\n\n        Automation\n            │\n            ▼\n\n       Integration\n\n```\n\nAll dependencies are unidirectional.\n\nDocument Identity has no dependency on the consuming components.\n\n---\n\n"
